<h1><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></h1>

<h1><a name=Internet><span style='background:red;mso-highlight:red'>Internet</span></a><span
style='background:red;mso-highlight:red'> Explorer keyboard shortcuts</span></h1>

<p>You can use shortcut keys to view and explore Web pages, preview pages
before printing, use the Address bar, work with favorites, and edit.</p>

<p>Click a heading, or press the TAB key to highlight a heading, and then press
ENTER.</p>

<p style='margin-left:.25in'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<div align=center>

